The wheel bundles pre-built JavaScript (src/steppy/_player_bundle/) compiled
from packages/player/, which includes Lit (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright Google LLC)
and Zod (MIT, Copyright Colin McDonnell). Their full license texts ship
beside the bundles in src/steppy/_player_bundle/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt.

Steppy invokes, but does not bundle or link, the following tools as separate
processes when the corresponding features are used: Playwright/Chromium
(Apache-2.0), ffmpeg (LGPL/GPL, depending on the build) and Piper (GPL-3.0).
